  "summary_md": "**Pika ([@pika_labs](https://x.com/pika_labs/status/2115860471215788262))** launches open-source **Pika H3 Flex**, post-trained on MiniMax H3 and ranked the top open-weight model on DesignArena's text-to-video board, with exportable audio stems, up to 4K, and a 15-second clip with soundtrack in as little as 7 seconds; code, weights, diffusers and ComfyUI support are available from day one ([GitHub](https://github.com/Pika-Labs/Pika-H3-Flex), [weights](https://huggingface.co/Pika-Labs/Pika-H3-Flex), [diffusers](https://huggingface.co/docs/diffusers/main/en/api/pipelines/pika_h3_flex), [ComfyUI](https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/video/pika/pika-h3-flex)).",
